<#b060ff>FLAME GAUGE / RIOT OF THE BLOOD</>
Riot of the Blood (flame gauge full)		^X
  Every hit he lands (or that gets blocked) feeds the flame
  gauge (bottom of the screen). At full, X with no direction
  held starts Riot of the Blood: a short roar, then 10 seconds
  in which all his attacks and flames deal 30% more damage
  and he glows purple. It empties the gauge. The gauge also
  resets every round. Normal Iori only (no palette modes).

<#b060ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab (Sakahagi)		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Zero Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Jump		_U

<#b060ff>NORMALS</>
  Chain: A > B > C (standing, crouching and in the air), upward
  only, on hit or block. Any normal that connected also cancels
  into specials, EX moves and supers.
  A / B / C are his light / medium / heavy punches. X is his
  light kick and the kick button for kick specials.
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Light Kick		^X
Ge-Shiki: Yumebiki		_F^B
Ge-Shiki: Gofun In "Shinigami" (overhead)		_F^X
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Crouching Light Kick		_D^X
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Light Kick		^X
Ge-Shiki: Yuriori (air)		_B^X

<#b060ff>SPECIALS</>
  C is the EX version (500 meter). Without the meter, C is
  the heavy version. Kick moves use X, and X_+^C for the EX.
108 Shiki: Yami Barai		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
100 Shiki: Oni Yaki		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
127 Shiki: Aoi Hana (repeat up to 3 times)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
311 Shiki: Tsuma Kushi		_F_D_DF^X
212 Shiki: Koto Tsuki In		_F_DF_D_DB_B^X
Kuzukaze (command grab)		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A / ^B / ^C

<#b060ff>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
